    "detailed_description": "Survival Nexus is an exhilarating survival game that immerses players in a post-apocalyptic world filled with challenges and dangers.<br><br>As a fearless survivor, you awaken in an unknown location, surrounded by the devastation caused by a cataclysmic event. Civilization has crumbled, and nature has reclaimed what remains. Now, your sole mission is to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598450/extras/90866bfdb1415008d00c0865e6ae9968.poster.avif?t=1697275531\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598450/extras/90866bfdb1415008d00c0865e6ae9968.webm?t=1697275531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598450/extras/90866bfdb1415008d00c0865e6ae9968.mp4?t=1697275531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this engaging game, you'll have to confront constant threats such as mutant creatures, unforgiving natural elements, and hostile groups of survivors in search of resources. Your cunning and adaptability will be put to the test as you struggle to find food, water, and shelter.<br><br>Build makeshift shelters, hunt for sustenance and valuable resources, and forge alliances with other survivors to increase your chances. Explore vast and diverse landscapes, each with its own secrets and challenges, as you seek answers about what caused this global catastrophe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598450/extras/9d67eae1b942efb01588740a2abf76f2.poster.avif?t=1697275531\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598450/extras/9d67eae1b942efb01588740a2abf76f2.webm?t=1697275